Privacy Policy for Image to PDF

Last updated: August 3, 2026

This Privacy Policy describes Our policies and procedures regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of Your information when You use the Service and explains Your privacy rights.

Image to PDF is built so that there is nothing to disclose. The Application has no user accounts, no servers, and no analytics. Your photos and the PDFs You create never leave Your Device. By using the Service, You agree to this Privacy Policy.

Summary

- We do not collect any Personal Data. There is no account to create and no data to sign in to.
- Photos are converted to PDF entirely on Your Device. Nothing is uploaded, and We never see Your images or documents.
- The Application contains no advertising networks, no analytics SDKs, and no third-party tracking technologies.
- We never sell or rent data, because We do not hold any.
- Subscriptions are handled entirely by Apple. We do not receive Your name, email address, or payment details.

