Collecting and Using Your Personal Data

Data We collect

None. The Application does not collect, transmit, or store Personal Data of any kind. It has no user accounts, no backend service, and no telemetry.

Your photos and documents

When You select photos, the Application reads them only to render the pages of Your PDF. All conversion, merging, page reordering, layout, and compression happens locally on Your Device using the operating system's own imaging frameworks. Neither the source images nor the resulting PDF are uploaded anywhere.

Files You create are written to Your Device, and You choose what happens to them next through the standard iOS share sheet. Once You share a file, the privacy policy of the destination You choose applies to it.

Photo library access

The Application uses Apple's system photo picker, which runs outside the Application. You choose exactly which photos to hand over, and the Application receives only those. It is never granted access to Your photo library as a whole, which is why iOS does not show a photo permission prompt.

Settings You choose

Your preferences — such as default page size and export quality — are stored only in the Application's own storage on Your Device. They are removed when You delete the Application.

Service Providers

The Application uses no third-party service providers, SDKs, or processors.

Apple processes subscription purchases and tells the Application whether an active subscription exists. This exchange happens between Your Device and Apple. We do not receive Your name, email address, or payment card details, and We operate no server that could receive them. Apple's handling of purchase data is governed by Apple's own privacy policy.

Retention and Deletion

We retain nothing, because We receive nothing. Everything the Application stores lives on Your Device, and deleting the Application removes it.

Deleting the Application does not cancel an active App Store subscription; subscriptions must be cancelled separately in Your Apple settings.

Your Rights

If You are in the European Economic Area, You have the right to access, correct, export, restrict, object to the processing of, and erase Your Personal Data. Because We do not collect or hold any Personal Data, there is nothing for Us to retrieve, amend, or erase on Your behalf — the data is already exclusively in Your possession on Your Device. You may still contact Us at the address below with any privacy question, and You have the right to lodge a complaint with Your local data protection authority (in the Netherlands: Autoriteit Persoonsgegevens).

Children

The Service does not collect Personal Data from anyone, including children. It is a general-purpose utility and is not directed at children under 13.

Security

Because Your photos and documents never leave Your Device, they are protected by the encryption and sandboxing of the Device itself. The Application opens no network connections of its own; purchase communication is handled by Apple over encrypted connections.

